Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?athena=5Fdefconfig:=20disable=20in-tree=20RTL88?=
 =?UTF-8?q?21CU=20=E2=80=94=20morrownr=208821cu.ko=20is=20the=20single=20W?=
 =?UTF-8?q?i-Fi=20driver?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Both drivers bind the same USB ID (0bda:c820); the plan prefers the
maintained morrownr out-of-tree driver. Building both risks a module
conflict at Phase-4 staging (retrospective 2026-07-19, compromise #6).
CONFIG_RTK_BTUSB (Bluetooth, separate Kconfig) is unaffected.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/athena_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/athena_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/athena_defconfig
index 9c46ced4a..6788a6abc 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/athena_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/athena_defconfig
@@ -189,7 +189,7 @@ CONFIG_NVETHERNET=y
 CONFIG_NVETHERNET_SELFTESTS=y
 CONFIG_USB_RTL8152=y
 CONFIG_USB_USBNET=y
-CONFIG_RTL8821CU=m
+# CONFIG_RTL8821CU is not set
 CONFIG_INPUT_MOUSEDEV=y
 CONFIG_INPUT_JOYDEV=y
 CONFIG_INPUT_EVDEV=y
